 "notes": "Matsui et al. identify the synthesized stoichiometric sample as B1-NaCl ferropericlase and report the ambient cubic lattice parameter a=4.2331(2) A. The Fm-3m conventional-cell sites are the standard crystallographic realization of that named B1 structure; mixed Mg/Fe occupancy gives Mg3.32Fe0.68O4 and Z=4. The fitted EOS V0=75.849(11) A^3 differs slightly from the directly observed ambient Table 1 volume 75.855(11) A^3 and from a^3 because the printed lattice parameter is rounded.",
